  "description": "A cross-platform replacement for the Windows-only System.Drawing.Common (GDI+), which throws PlatformNotSupportedException off Windows as of .NET 7. SkiaSharp-based drawing primitives (Brush, Pen, Font, FontFamily, Image, Bitmap, Icon, Region, StringFormat, GraphicsPath, Matrix, Imaging codecs, etc.) implementing the GDI+ / System.Drawing surface that Majorsilence.Forms consumes. Value types (Color, Point, PointF, Size, SizeF, Rectangle, RectangleF) are deliberately NOT reimplemented -- the real cross-platform BCL System.Drawing.Primitives types are used instead. Originally developed as part of Majorsilence.Reporting.",
  "id": "Majorsilence.Forms.Drawing.Common",
